      "name": "杨嗣复",
      "claim_id": "84cfeb2e-967c-5a54-a528-263bcdb458ec",
      "quotation": "昭俭，嗣复之曾孙也。",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；三月条下）·zztj-v279-y0935-p012·原文件第96行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
