    },
    {
      "person_id": "4d43c16a-22c8-593d-ba83-347e273efd9a",
      "name": "毋昭裔",
      "claim_id": "d4045109-254b-5ffa-a257-b2ce5ebe18e7",
      "quotation": "夏，四月，庚午，蜀以御史中丞龙门毋昭裔为中书侍郎、同平章事。",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；四月条下）·zztj-v279-y0935-p014·原文件第98行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/82c9d42c/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-10/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-year-end/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "fadb91dac524ff4eb395a911f03221a27b18e2d4aeb53e58a9d3ae75da836d66"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "4e688db5-7a48-5fbc-a4b3-45d22d254217",
      "name": "柴再用",
      "claim_id": "e7786ec2-06fb-5b71-a052-2f45cc65d4e4",
      "quotation": "杨行密围寿州，不克，将还；庚寅，其将硃延寿请试往更攻，一鼓拨之，执剌史江从勖。行密以延寿权知寿州团练使。未几，汴兵数万攻寿州，州中兵少，吏民忷惧。延寿制，军中每旗二十五骑。命黑云队长李厚将十旗击汴兵，不胜；延寿将斩之，厚称众寡不敌，愿益兵更往，不胜则死。都押牙汝阳柴再用亦为之请，乃益以五旗。厚殊死战，再用助之，延寿悉众乘之，汴兵败走。厚，蔡州人也。行密又遣兵袭涟水，拨之。",
      "citation": "卷260·乾宁二年（895）·zztj-v260-y0895-p020·原文件第25行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/17a0b9a305d40d6371bbdd66d1827c8f2f7321fa/resources/derived/tongjian/260.txt",
      "source_sha256": "d1ae910c349e273604f05ad6879e5fe7870c482bc567dea101bf40593faa812e"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "b44df414-ad65-574e-ac28-5f8707f9f686",
      "name": "王振（吴史官）",
      "claim_id": "58b00f4b-30d9-59fd-8b01-a6795f63388d",
      "quotation": "先是，史官王振尝询其战功，",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；六月条下及附载追叙）·zztj-v279-y0935-p017·原文件第101行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/0a39d9d7/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0935/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-279-935-middle/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "26f41811ec005fa18fa7608415fb26783e13e138d62a87ace7388429300bd80b"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "845c43a9-912b-516b-bc61-71674907ccfa",
      "name": "李专美",
      "claim_id": "018d340f-b21a-595c-ba04-79a2c4b5a520",
      "quotation": "帝患之，李专美夜直，帝让之曰：“卿名有才，不能为我谋此，留才安所施乎！”",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰元年（934；四月条下，改元前为应顺元年）·zztj-v279-y0934-p034·原文件第39行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "6c04e553-0a04-5dbe-9236-85f04393f290",
      "name": "赵延乂",
      "claim_id": "118c915d-41f1-5ac6-8c4b-93cf8673bdbb",
      "quotation": "帝好咨访外事，常命端明殿学士李专美、翰林学士李崧、知制诰吕琦、薛文遇、翰林天文赵延乂等更直于中兴殿庭，与语或至夜分。",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；六月条下及附载追叙）·zztj-v279-y0935-p019·原文件第103行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/0a39d9d7/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0935/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-279-935-middle/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "26f41811ec005fa18fa7608415fb26783e13e138d62a87ace7388429300bd80b"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "6ef55b9f-6fef-5ad4-b449-50af87f1033f",
      "name": "曹氏（李嗣源后）",
      "claim_id": "49ce067f-f287-5d01-bcf1-edf5bc1510bf",
      "quotation": "帝将立曹淑妃为后，淑妃谓王德妃曰：“吾素病中烦，倦于接对，妹代我为之。”德妃曰：“中宫敌偶至尊，谁敢干之！”",
      "citation": "卷277·长兴元年（930）·zztj-v277-y0930-p010·原文件第15行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/238471e3/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0930/part-01/sources/library/tongjian-277-930-spring/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "6b210920bd1afb2947132d862e2594da126ea4424a7f792cd9d0921ad4d5797c"
    },
    {
      "person_id": "6c7c331d-9394-5391-93f2-ed492d06f8f5",
      "name": "李晖（挟马都将）",
      "claim_id": "426fcba0-bd7b-5e77-9d31-c86112492634",
      "quotation": "敬瑭命都押衙刘知远斩挟马都将李晖等三十六人以徇。",
      "citation": "卷279·清泰二年（935；六月条下及附载追叙）·zztj-v279-y0935-p019·原文件第103行",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/0a39d9d7/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0935/part-02/sources/library/tongjian-279-935-middle/source.txt",
